%% Data Lineage — Clickstream to Metrics
flowchart TD
    A[Raw Event<br/>SDK Payload] --> B{Schema Valid?}
    B -- No --> DLQ[Dead Letter Queue]
    B -- Yes --> C[Bot Score]
    C --> D{Bot?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Bot Sink<br/>(kept for analysis)]
    D -- No --> F[Enrich<br/>user/geo/device]
    F --> G[Iceberg Bronze<br/>raw layer]
    G --> H[Iceberg Silver<br/>cleaned layer]
    H --> I[Iceberg Gold<br/>user_metric_daily]
    I --> J[Statistical Engine]
    J --> K[Experiment Results Table]
    K --> L[Dashboard / API]
    H --> M[Guardrail Streaming Job]
    M -->|breach| N[Auto-Stop Webhook]
